---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import WikiTOC from "../../components/WikiTOC.astro";
import WikiInfoBox from "../../components/WikiInfoBox.astro";
import WikiAccordion from "../../components/WikiAccordion.astro";
---
<!-- Load Base Layout -->
<BaseLayout title="Wiki - RaccStarLogan" description="A collection of information about me, my work, and other random stuff.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/wiki.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/wiki/styles/emily-reeves.css" />
  <div class="wiki-page-grid">
    <aside class="wiki-sidebar">
      <h2>Info box</h2>
      <WikiInfoBox title="Quick facts" variant="info">
        Use this area for quick metadata, related links, or a summary box like a wiki info panel.
      </WikiInfoBox>
      <h2>More links</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/links">Links</a></li>
        <li><a href="/portfolio">Portfolio</a></li>
        <li><a href="/commissions">Commissions</a></li>
      </ul>
    </aside>

    <main id="wiki-content" class="article-section">
    <h1>Wiki Framework Demo</h1>

    <WikiInfoBox title="Note" variant="info">
      This is an info box. Use <strong>variant="warning"</strong>, <strong>success</strong>, etc. for style.
    </WikiInfoBox>

    <div class="wiki-toc-wrapper"><WikiTOC /></div>

    <h2 id="section-1">Section 1: Intro</h2>
    <p>Use headings with id, or allow the TOC script to autogenerate ids.</p>

    <WikiAccordion summary="Click to expand details">
      <p>Accordion-style collapse/expand for longer details.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Item A</li>
        <li>Item B</li>
      </ul>
    </WikiAccordion>

    <h2 id="section-table">Table</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Header 1</th>
          <th>Header 2</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Cell 1</td>
          <td>Cell 2</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 id="section-tags">Tags (Custom Components)</h2>
    <p>With this style, you can create a markdown-like syntax in MDX or Astroweb MVC by reusing these components as tags.</p>

    <h2 id="section-lorem">Lorem Ipsum Overflow</h2>
    <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Curabitur pretium leo a tellus pharetra, in dignissim erat luctus. Sed eu urna sed elit pellentesque scelerisque. Nulla facilisi. Maecenas aliquet quam nec nunc porta, ut fermentum neque bibendum. Phasellus porttitor, ligula sed aliquet sagittis, dui orci venenatis dui, nec dictum lacus nisi vitae lectus. Quisque maximus odio in dui laoreet, a egestas felis scelerisque. Donec congue blandit ligula, non ornare tellus tristique quis. Cras vulputate tellus id augue ultricies, vitae bibendum nisl aliquet. Donec non posuere purus. Cras eget feugiat nulla.</p>
    <p>Fusce vitae urna justo. Vestibulum eleifend lectus a consequat pulvinar. Praesent mollis lectus vitae tincidunt vestibulum. Vivamus scelerisque suscipit mauris at maximus. In quis tortor eu ex sollicitudin pulvinar. Nulla consectetur, neque sed pretium hendrerit, augue sapien porttitor ipsum, ut congue quam sapien eget dolor. Duis pretium tellus vitae elit dictum, sit amet egestas erat semper. Sed eu ullamcorper lectus. Nullam nec augue ipsum.</p>
    <p>Praesent bibendum enim vel leo sodales, vel vulputate arcu rutrum. Vestibulum ante ipsum primis in faucibus orci luctus et ultrices posuere cubilia curae; Duis rhoncus urna vitae risus cursus, ut dignissim ex sagittis. Aliquam erat volutpat. Integer in dolor justo. Integer eget ex nunc. Curabitur non nisl at elit dapibus efficitur id sed eros. Donec sed libero velit. Nulla facilisi.</p>
  </main>
</div>
</BaseLayout>